Package: zuint
Title: Lossless 64- And 128-Bit Integers for 'Arrow' and 'DuckDB'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Wide integer vectors, signed and unsigned 64-bit and 128-bit,
    matching the integer types of 'Apache Arrow' and 'DuckDB'. The four types
    share one 'C' core and one lossless promotion order, with exact
    arithmetic, comparison, parsing and formatting, and explicit overflow
    policies. The signed 64-bit type keeps the 'bit64' 'integer64' storage
    layout, and every type converts exactly to and from the 'Arrow' 'C' Data
    Interface.
